ent (97%, 26%, 0%) — no idea what it says about the fund","חשיפה בסוף ספטמבר 2026","מההפקדות vs מהחיסכון","The yellow/turquoise rings next to the numbers — I guessed a fuller ring is 'more S&P'","The 'קופה' number (13874 etc.) — I guess an ID","'עוד לא דווח' and the 'חדש' tag","'פחות מ־3 שנים' in place of a return","Words like גמיש, סחיר, אשראי ואג\"ח, ממשלתי"],"not_found":["What the fee comes to in shekels on 30,000 ₪","Which button to press or how to actually open the fund (a first step)","A clear explanation of what a קופת גמל להשקעה is and whether the money is locked up","Monthly deposits — how much and how"],"findings":[{"what":"In א and ב there's no past return at all, so I can't tell which one does better. Only ג has it, and that's what made me pick it.","where":"Sections א and ב"},{"what":"The page is endlessly long: the same table three times, with dozens of rows that look alike. On a phone I'd give up in the middle.","where":"Screens 2–7"},{"what":"Two fees in every row with no explanation of which one counts. And the percentages (0.52% vs 0.71%) look like nothing to me. I'd want to see it in shekels.","where":"דמי ניהול column"},{"what":"The מט\"ח column and the rings aren't explained next to them. I don't understand why one S&P has 97% and a 'stocks' fund has 26%.","where":"חשיפה column"},{"what":"There's no 'what to do now' button. The arrow at the end of the row doesn't say where it goes.","where":"End of each row"},{"what":"In ג some funds show 'פחות מ־3 שנים' instead of a return, so they look like they have nothing to show.","where":"Returns column in ג"}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4845,"cache_read_input_tokens":15524,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4845},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"di